ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Parece que ya es hora de cerrar...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}¡Vuelve cuando vuelva a picarte
el gusanillo de la jardinería!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Mi dispiace, ma stavo chiudendo.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Torna pure a trovarmi la prossima
volta che ti pruderà il pollice verde!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ich schließe den Laden für heute.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Aber komm wieder, wenn du Lust
aufs Gärtnern hast!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Aa, sanırım bugünlük kapatma
vakti.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Bahçe havasına girince yine gel!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Magnifico!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Grazie mille!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Per tutti i pistilli! Costa {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:000C:0000}}
stelline{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ma tu sei a corto di liquidi...

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Juhu! Danke!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Halt, einen Moment, du hast keine
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:000C:0000}} Sternis{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}...

TRANSLATION:
Bir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}balta{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} alırsan{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ağaç kesebilirsin.
TAK!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Onu {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}cepler{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} ekranından kuşan.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ağaca dönüp  tuşuna basarak{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
baltayı sallarsın.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ah, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}hai bisogno di qualcuno
che strappi le erbacce?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Sì, la situazione sta peggiorando
a vista d'occhio!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} È proprio ora
che qualcuno faccia qualcosa!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Se mi dai una conferma subito,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
farò in modo che la città brilli come
uno specchio entro domani mattina!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Visto il lavoro che mi aspetta,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}30.000 stelline {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}mi sembrano eque.
Allora?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Che ne dici, fiorellino?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Affare fatto!
No, grazie.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}OK!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Torna con le stelline necessarie{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ed io sarò felice di aiutarti
con le tue erbacce!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tamam,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} yeterli Bell ile geri
gel,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
küçük ot sorununa yardım ederim.
